+## Phase 3: User Story 1 - Capture Tasks with Reminders (Priority: P1) 🎯 MVP
+
+**Goal**: Allow users to create tasks with optional reminders and view them immediately in the active list with notifications scheduled.
+
+**Independent Test**: Using Playwright, create a task with a reminder and confirm it appears in the active list with reminder metadata and triggers a simulated in-app notification.
