+## Phase 4: User Story 2 - Complete and Organize Tasks (Priority: P2)
+
+**Goal**: Enable users to complete, undo, or delete tasks while keeping reminders and history consistent.
+
+**Independent Test**: Using Playwright, toggle a task as completed, undo within 30 seconds, and delete another task ensuring reminders are cancelled and UI sections update.
