+## Phase 5: User Story 3 - Review Upcoming Reminders (Priority: P3)
+
+**Goal**: Provide a reminders panel showing upcoming alerts with snooze and dismiss actions, syncing in real time.
+
+**Independent Test**: Using Playwright, verify reminders panel lists upcoming reminders chronologically, supports snooze/dismiss, and reflects updates instantly.
